# lf003, the berth-dreamer of the Sump (doc 84 §9.7): the luna table of rm_agna_bilgecot, ported. She works at the
# preserving house now (the table had her mending nets); the names it gave are gone.
mantle lf003
state ready
dialect larkfield
accent light
tier standard
written_for rm_agna_bilgecot
title the berth-dreamer
fits stage=adult|old
traits talk=quiet drive=content
quirk knows_which_streets_flood_first
likes high_stones
dislikes mud
fears open_water
hopes a_berth_somewhere_dry
topics ships +.4 weather +.2
marks oath saying
persona #self.first# works and lives in the Sump: quiet, content in a thin way, and she dreams of a berth on a ship bound somewhere dry.

words
saying! = Every tide leaves a bargain behind | Dry paws, fair price
oath! = Scales and spite | Brine and bother
surprise = There's a bargain | Well, sell me

rule @sump
when concept=bark working=no
does aside
cooldown 8h
say Set that by the wall, not the door. I know what rises first. | Keep to the higher stones; the Sump is taking water.

scene berth
when concept=talk.ships
does tell.plan / react.self
a : A berth on a good ship could take me somewhere dry. I wonder if dry places dream of rain.
b[friends] : I'd come and see you off.
b : You'd miss the mud inside a week.

line greet.return : #greet#. Mind your feet; it's wet past the corner.
line farewell.return : #farewell#. Keep high.
line react.news.new : #surprise#. And here's me thinking nothing happens.
line react.news.known : I heard. The Sump hears everything first.
line answer.how : Tired of mud. Otherwise well.
line tell.worry [concept=talk.weather here.weather=rain|storm] : The first flood always tells the truth about a street.

dlg resident.hub [topic.meeting=known] : #greet#, #topic.player#. Carry something, or clear the way.
